# Six 16x16 frames, 3x2: buster, cannon, wide-shot — cyan on top for the
# player, magenta below for the virus.
#
# One texture and six source rectangles rather than six files; these are always
# loaded together and never used apart, which is what a sheet is actually for.
#
# The two rows are the same drawings with the hue swapped, deliberately. A shot
# is a shot; the only thing the player needs to read in the 200ms one is on
# screen is whose it is.
name battlegrid-shots
size 48 32
key o outline
key C cyan-2
key H cyan-3-hilite
key m magenta-2
key M magenta-3-hilite
pixels
